The task is to develop a web application using the FastAPI framework that provides a product recommendation service based on user-specified tags. The application will have two main functionalities: retrieving products that match given tags and allowing users to post new products with associated tags. The data will be stored in an SQLite database.

### Summary of the Plan
The implementation plan includes setting up a FastAPI application, creating an SQLite database with a suitable table structure for products and tags, and developing two endpoints: a GET endpoint to fetch products based on tags and a POST endpoint to add new products. The GET endpoint will return results formatted in HTML, and the application will be tested locally to ensure functionality.

